# Low index contrast: a large mode, and a regime where the semi-vectorial approximation is good.
# Reference: the same grid solved with a sparse eigen-solver in SciPy. Bounds: cladding index and slab index.
title Silicon nitride 1000 x 400 nm, quasi-TM
grid dx=0.05 dy=0.04
window width=6.0 ymin=-2.0 ymax=2.4
rect sin -0.5 0.5 0 0.4
symmetry even
field tm
expect neff 1.570205664 2e-8
expect group_index 1.955993741 2e-6
expect confinement 0.361297794 1e-6
expect area 1.218400028 1e-5
expect guided yes
expect cells 6600
expect neff_between 1.444 1.641680
